; main.pk - KDP profile as a Plankalkuel sketch (Konrad Zuse, 1942-45)
; Plankalkuel has no I/O, so this only holds the data; it prints nothing.
; Real notation is 2-dimensional (rows V, K, S); this is a linear
; transliteration and not guaranteed valid Plankalkuel.
;
; Types (S row): A8 = 8 bits (one character), n.A8 = array of n characters
;
; id     = "KDPMember:KL5UQ4f48673352"   25 x A8
; code   = id[10..24]                    15 x A8   (after the prefix)
; role   = "Member"                       6 x A8
; points = 1                              A8

P1 KdpProfile (V0[:25.A8], V1[:6.A8]) => R0
    ; Z (counter) walks the 15 characters after the prefix
    10 => Z0
    W [ Z0 < 25 ]
        V0[Z0] => V2[Z0 - 10]
        Z0 + 1 => Z0
    1 => V3
    ; result R0 = (code, role, points)
V |  0   1   2   3
S | 25.A8 6.A8 15.A8 A8
